BitcoinScore — Full Repository Audit

1. Purpose & Overview

Bitcoin Buy Risk is a personal, open-source composite index that scores Bitcoin's current market positioning on a 0–100 scale (0 = extreme bottom, 100 = extreme top). It is designed to reduce emotional decision-making for long-horizon investors by aggregating 10+ on-chain and macro/technical indicators into a single daily-updated signal. The index is published as a static GitHub Pages site and as an iCal calendar feed.

